   $q$What leads Dev to conclude that Pruitt forgave the Castellano debt?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The slip in the binding says the family owed nothing more.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Mrs. Halvorsen tells him that Pruitt was known for his kindness.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"All the entries were marked paid at once, without initials, in different ink.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The family stopped buying from the store after November.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$All the entries were marked paid at once, without initials, in different ink.$q$, $q$Unlike the normal pattern, every entry was marked "Pd." on one day with no customer initials, which suggests Pruitt cleared it himself. The slip says only "R.C. fixed store pump," and Mrs. Halvorsen offers it as a different possibility.$q$, 'draft', 'ec3b98c9-71ed-544e-9759-eba25dd6a1df')
