   $q$The coach folds the scoresheet into the pocket where he keeps games "he planned to study." What does this suggest, and what does the text leave uncertain?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows he thinks she played badly, though it is unclear whether Dario will reach the state event.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstated-inference"},{"text":"It shows he is angry about the loss, though it is unclear whether he will keep coaching her.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It suggests he finds the game worth studying, though he never says what he thinks of her choice.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows he already knew about the clock, though it is unclear who set the clock wrong.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It suggests he finds the game worth studying, though he never says what he thinks of her choice.$q$, $q$Keeping the sheet with games he plans to study suggests he values it, and his surprised look hints at respect, but he never speaks his opinion aloud. The text says Dario set the clock, so that point is not uncertain.$q$, 'draft', '79af5ab3-d9e4-57f8-b7c8-5744625a1d25')
